# Allowlist: ignore everything, then admit only what the API image needs.
# A denylist leaks whatever lands in the checkout next - .env, the private
# study sheet, a 500MB node_modules - so the default here is "no".
*

# how to install
!.python-version
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

# the service
!churn/
churn/__pycache__

# The agent's output. Everything else the API reads (database, model, metrics,
# action log) is rebuilt inside the image; these two come from a paid LLM run
# and cannot be, so without them /investigations and /reliability are empty.
!churn_predictions.json
!agent_trace.json
